  <div class="page">

    <header class="identity">
      <p class="name">divya tak · divyatak.art</p>
      <h1>I make interactive things.</h1>
      <p class="more">I want the viewer to feel like they're in it. Not just looking at it through glass.</p>
    </header>

    <p class="order-note">one record. ordered by last use, newest at the top. made dates in the data.</p>

    <div class="record">

      <!-- this site: the record lists itself, flat -->
      <section class="entry" data-entry="site">
        <span class="marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="flatline"><span class="t">this site</span> · made 2026 · in use: you, now</p>
      </section>

      <!-- metro museum: T1, the rule runs small on real records -->
      <section class="entry" data-entry="mm">
        <span class="marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="meta"><span class="t">metro museum of the forgotten</span> · made 2026 · in progress · act: hold</p>
        <div class="box">
          <p class="label">A museum built from 24,646 things people lost on the Delhi Metro.</p>
          <p class="hook">people lose whole days on the metro and file a report hoping. I am sorting every report into wings I named myself: tiffin, worn-body, against-weather. six of the 24,646 are below.</p>
          <ul class="mm-list" id="mm-list">
            <li><button class="rec" aria-expanded="false">
              <span class="ri">BLACK PURSE</span> · <span class="rs">PUNJABI BAGH</span><span class="rev"> · &ldquo;purse with cash&rdquo; · <span class="rc">currency</span> · <span class="rd">01/12/2024</span></span>
            </button></li>
            <li><button class="rec" aria-expanded="false">
              <span class="ri">POLYBAG</span> · <span class="rs">RAMAKRISHNA ASHRAM MARG</span><span class="rev"> · &ldquo;old clothes&rdquo; · <span class="rc">worn-body</span> · <span class="rd">01/12/2024</span></span>
            </button></li>
            <li><button class="rec" aria-expanded="false">
              <span class="ri">BAG WITH</span> · <span class="rs">MILLENNIUM CITY CENTRE GURUGRAM</span><span class="rev"> · &ldquo;lunch box, bottle&rdquo; · <span class="rc">tiffin</span> · <span class="rd">27/11/2024</span></span>
            </button></li>
            <li><button class="rec" aria-expanded="false">
              <span class="ri">JUTI</span> · <span class="rs">SHASTRI NAGAR</span><span class="rev"> · &ldquo;juti&rdquo; · <span class="rc">unclaimed</span> · <span class="rd">29/11/2024</span></span>
            </button></li>
            <li><button class="rec" aria-expanded="false">
              <span class="ri">BAG</span> · <span class="rs">SAROJINI NAGAR</span><span class="rev"> · &ldquo;jackets, shirts &amp; overcoat&rdquo; · <span class="rc">against-weather</span> · <span class="rd">30/11/2024</span></span>
            </button></li>
            <li><button class="rec" aria-expanded="false">
              <span class="ri">WATCH &amp; NECKBAND</span> · <span class="rs">KARKARDUMA</span><span class="rev"> · <span class="rc">listening-ear</span> · <span class="rd">29/11/2024</span></span>
            </button></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- klydo: testimony, the only container that fits it -->
      <section class="entry" data-entry="klydo">
        <span class="marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="meta"><span class="t">klydo</span> · ongoing · act: read</p>
        <blockquote class="testimony">
          <p>I lead product design at Klydo. That is close to a decade of work and none of it fits on a page like this. The evidence is plainer than a portfolio: things people opened every working day, for years, until they stopped noticing them. That is the only kind of review I trust.</p>
        </blockquote>
      </section>

      <!-- everything bazaar: T1, one exclusive pick, typographic only -->
      <section class="entry" data-entry="eb">
        <span class="marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="meta"><span class="t">everything bazaar</span> · made 2026 · live · act: pick one</p>
        <div class="box">
          <p class="label">A bazaar that trades in feelings.</p>
          <p class="hook">you tell it how you feel and it gives you a thing for it. it is stocked for two feelings today.</p>
          <div class="eb-pair" id="eb-pair">
            <button class="feel" data-feel="loneliness" aria-pressed="false">loneliness</button>
            <button class="feel" data-feel="boredom" aria-pressed="false">boredom</button>
          </div>
          <p class="eb-link" id="eb-link" hidden><a href="https://everythingbazaar.netlify.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">everythingbazaar.netlify.app</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- bioluminescent flow: T0, the thing linked live -->
      <section class="entry" data-entry="bio">
        <span class="marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="meta"><span class="t">bioluminescent flow</span> · made 2026 · live · act: disturb</p>
        <div class="box">
          <p class="hook">bioluminescent algae glow when something moves through them. here the something is your hand, over webcam.</p>
          <a class="thumb" href="https://divyatak.github.io/creative-visuals/particles/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <img src="/playground/bioluminescent-flow.webp" alt="Bioluminescent Flow: a dark field of glowing blue particles" loading="lazy" />
          </a>
          <p class="plainlink"><a href="https://divyatak.github.io/creative-visuals/particles/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">divyatak.github.io/creative-visuals/particles</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- webcam magic: T0 -->
      <section class="entry" data-entry="webcam">
        <span class="marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="meta"><span class="t">webcam magic</span> · made 2026 · live · act: point</p>
        <div class="box">
          <p class="hook">a pixelated mirror that follows your finger. you can ripple it, erase it, paint on it.</p>
          <a class="thumb" href="https://divyatak.github.io/creative-visuals/webcam/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <img src="/playground/webcam-magic.webp" alt="Webcam Magic: a pixelated webcam mirror mid-effect" loading="lazy" />
          </a>
          <p class="plainlink"><a href="https://divyatak.github.io/creative-visuals/webcam/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">divyatak.github.io/creative-visuals/webcam</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- (un)seen: looked at, whole and generous -->
      <section class="entry" data-entry="unseen">
        <span class="marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="meta"><span class="t">(un)seen</span> · begun 2024, still going · act: looked at</p>
        <div class="box">
          <p class="label">A world drawn over the real one.</p>
          <p class="hook">&ldquo;I draw into photographs of streets I'd have walked straight past, until I can't walk past them anymore.&rdquo;</p>
          <div class="unseen-grid">
            <figure>
              <a href="/works/unseen-istanbul/"><img src="/projects/2024/(un)seen Istanbul/cover.webp" alt="(un)seen Istanbul cover: illustration drawn over a photograph of an Istanbul street" loading="lazy" /></a>
              <figcaption>istanbul · 2024</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <a href="/works/unseen-vietnam/"><img src="/projects/2024/(un)seen Vietnam/cover.webp" alt="(un)seen Vietnam cover: illustration drawn over a photograph of a Vietnam street" loading="lazy" /></a>
              <figcaption>vietnam · 2024</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <a href="/works/unseen-emirates/"><img src="/projects/2025/(un)seen Emirates/cover.webp" alt="(un)seen Emirates cover: illustration drawn over a photograph from the Emirates" loading="lazy" /></a>
              <figcaption>emirates · 2025</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <a href="/works/unseen-life/"><img src="/projects/2026/(un)seen Life/cover.webp" alt="(un)seen Life cover: illustration drawn over an everyday photograph" loading="lazy" /></a>
              <figcaption>life · 2026</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
          <div class="lent">
            <a class="lent-thumb" href="https://divyatak.github.io/creative-visuals/lenticular/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <img src="/playground/lenticular.webp" alt="(un)seen lenticular edition: a photograph mid-shift into its drawing" loading="lazy" />
            </a>
            <p class="lent-text">
              <span class="t2">lenticular edition · live</span>
              the photograph and the drawing in one plate. the shift between them happens there, not here.<br />
              <a href="https://divyatak.github.io/creative-visuals/lenticular/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">divyatak.github.io/creative-visuals/lenticular</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- talks: flat dated lines, one run -->
      <section class="entry" data-entry="talks">
        <span class="marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="meta"><span class="t">talks</span> · 2022 to 2026</p>
        <ul class="run">
          <li><span class="yr">2026</span> Algorithm and Art · NGMA Bangalore</li>
          <li><span class="yr">2024</span> Games and Literature · Goethe Institut</li>
          <li><span class="yr">2024</span> The Innovative Power of AI in Creative Industries · IIM Bangalore</li>
          <li><span class="yr">2023</span> AI and Copyright · Fifth Elephant</li>
          <li><span class="yr">2022</span> Product Design Learnings · UXDX</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- the line before: T0 -->
      <section class="entry" data-entry="lb">
        <span class="marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="meta"><span class="t">the line before</span> · made 2025 · live · act: wander</p>
        <div class="box">
          <p class="hook">a garden in 3D where the flowers grow out of poems. made with Kahran. it still lives at my old address.</p>
          <a class="thumb" href="https://divya.studiotypo.xyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <img src="/playground/the-line-before.webp" alt="The Line Before: a 3D garden of glowing flowers grown from lines of poetry" loading="lazy" />
          </a>
          <p class="plainlink"><a href="https://divya.studiotypo.xyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">divya.studiotypo.xyz</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- titli: data plus facts -->
      <section class="entry" data-entry="titli">
        <span class="marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="meta"><a class="t" href="/works/the-titli-effect/">the titli effect</a> · made 2024 · with my sister Charu · act: choose</p>
        <p class="hook">you make small choices for a girl called Titli and her life keeps every one of them.</p>
        <p class="flatline">2nd place · Jennifer Ann Group Connectedness game jam</p>
      </section>

      <!-- zines and comics: compact strip -->
      <section class="entry" data-entry="zines">
        <span class="marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="meta"><span class="t">zines and comics</span> · 2016 to 2022 · act: read</p>
        <p class="hook">paper holds still, which is sometimes the point.</p>
        <p class="striplinks">
          <a href="/works/how-to-think/">how to think, 2022</a> ·
          <a href="/works/common/">common, 2021</a> ·
          <a href="/works/wonderful-worlds/">wonderful worlds, 2019</a> ·
          <a href="/works/pi-of-life/">pi of life, 2016</a>
