        <li><span class="yr"></span> illustration feature · Creative Gaga · <a href="https://www.creativegaga.com/design/graphic-design/instincts-brocade" target="_blank" rel="noopener">creativegaga.com</a></li>
        <li><span class="yr"></span> podcast · <a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/1T3uIPziUpoETZr2fm8zbf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">spotify</a></li>
      </ul>
    </footer>

  </div>

